@host = http://localhost:5165

### Create an order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalAmount": 125.50,
  "currency": "eur"
}

### Get an order (paste the id from the response above)
GET {{host}}/orders/01a1ca91-5ac7-7fad-a4db-b14f973e22c6

### Invalid order (should return 400)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalAmount": -5,
  "currency": "EU"
}

### Order that doesn't exist (should return 404)
GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000